"<p>When Nitrobase runs behind a reverse proxy (such as Traefik or Cloudflare), incoming requests may appear to originate from the proxy's IP address.</p>\n<h2>Configuring TRUST_PROXY</h2>\n<p>To ensure that rate limiters, audit logs, and security notifications capture the authentic client IP address:</p>\n<ol>\n<li>Set <code>TRUST_PROXY=true</code> in your Nitrobase <code>.env</code>.</li>\n<li>Configure <code>TRUSTED_PROXY_HOPS</code> (default is <code>1</code>).</li>\n</ol>\n<pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"--shiki-light:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8;--shiki-light-bg:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e\" tabindex=\"0\"><code class=\"language-bash\"><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"--shiki-light:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">TRUST_PROXY</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">true</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"--shiki-light:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">TRUSTED_PROXY_HOPS</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">1</span></span></code></pre>"